# 4. APPLICATION ARCHITECTURE

Build a mobile-first Progressive Web Application.

The application must work on:

- Android smartphones.
- iPhones.
- Tablets.
- Desktop browsers.

The mobile experience is the highest priority.

Use:

- React.
- Vite.
- TypeScript.
- Tailwind CSS.
- Firebase Authentication.
- Cloud Firestore.
